  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Niger Delegation(2025 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Niger, the ICRC helps people affected by conflict in the south-east or fleeing fighting in north-east Nigeria. With the Niger Red Cross, we deliver aid, treat the wounded, provide water and support farmers. We monitor IHL compliance, protect detainees and help them maintain contact with their families.</narrative>
  </description>
